From a8114b5da051f5e677940c8ea1561729d32828df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timothy Schmidt <timschmidt@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 07:02:23 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: display: panel: add the Fx0 production example

The LTS tree already contains the attributed production-panel binding.
Append its ordinary example, preserving all existing requirements and
descriptions. Keep the complete board's GPIOs, power and graph unchanged.

Actual-source host tests reproduce 16 touch and eight panel cleanup
failures before the changes and none afterward. Four targeted power/PM
regressions and three DSI command regressions are rejected. Native ARM,
ARM64 and ARM64 RT objects compile with nonpermissive CFI; built-in,
modular and DRM-disabled profiles are checked. All nineteen maintained
family/control DTBs validate against the full schema, with 25 focused
binding cases. Low-level I/O, runtime callback schedules and selected
core operations are modeled; real hardware and complete kernel driver
core execution, panel timing and RMI disable-failure recovery remain open.

Codex prepared this local reconciliation and qualification, preserving
the original author, date and source notices. Human DCO and review are
pending; no sign-off certification, phone action or publication is claimed.

Backported from commit bffc782a349d ("dt-bindings: display: panel: Add
LG Fx0 production panel")
---
 .../bindings/display/panel/lg,fx0-panel.yaml  | 27 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 27 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/lg,fx0-panel.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/lg,fx0-panel.yaml
index 8395b7be5e68..1e1b9ee64176 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/lg,fx0-panel.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/lg,fx0-panel.yaml
@@ -57,3 +57,30 @@ required:
   - port
 
 additionalProperties: false
+
+examples:
+  - |
+    #include <dt-bindings/gpio/gpio.h>
+
+    dsi {
+        #address-cells = <1>;
+        #size-cells = <0>;
+
+        panel@0 {
+            compatible = "lg,fx0-panel";
+            reg = <0>;
+
+            vdd-supply = <&pm8226_l28>;
+            reset-gpios = <&tlmm 25 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
+            io-enable-gpios = <&tlmm 113 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
+            positive-enable-gpios = <&tlmm 111 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
+            negative-enable-gpios = <&tlmm 112 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
+            backlight = <&pm8226_wled>;
+
+            port {
+                endpoint {
+                    remote-endpoint = <&mdss_dsi0_out>;
+                };
+            };
+        };
+    };
-- 
